<view class="page">
  <view class="section-title">隐私政策</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view wx:for="{{privacy}}" wx:key="*this" class="privacy-item">
      <text class="dot">·</text>
      <text class="privacy-text">{{item}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">关于</view>
  <view class="card about">
    <view class="about-name">保养指南</view>
    <view class="muted tiny">告诉你什么该换，什么不用换</view>
    <view class="about-row">数据来源：厂商随车保养手册整理</view>
    <view class="about-row">数据存储：本机本地，不上传云端，可备份恢复</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">数据</view>
  <view class="entry" bindtap="backupData">
    <text class="entry-label">备份我的数据</text>
    <text class="entry-arrow">›</text>
  </view>
  <view class="entry" bindtap="restoreData">
    <text class="entry-label">恢复备份数据</text>
    <text class="entry-arrow">›</text>
  </view>
  <button class="btn-ghost clear" bindtap="clearCache">清空本地缓存</button>

  <view class="entry" bindtap="openPrivacy">
    <text class="entry-label">查看隐私政策</text>
    <text class="entry-arrow">›</text>
  </view>

  <view class="tiny muted center" style="margin-top: 48rpx;">
    本产品不构成维修指令，实际请以专业检测结果为准
  </view>

  <privacy-modal />
</view>
